#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ccsn-observability/overview.js:12
#, javascript-format
msgid "%s must use lowercase letters, digits, hyphens, or underscores."
msgstr "%s 只能包含小写字母、数字、连字符或下划线。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ccsn-observability/overview.js:43
msgid "CCSN Observability"
msgstr "CCSN 可观测性"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ccsn-observability/overview.js:44
msgid ""
"Configure Prometheus endpoints and DHCP-aware client accounting. Client IDs "
"use DHCP hostnames and fall back to MAC addresses when no hostname is "
"available. Firewall access is managed separately."
msgstr ""
"配置 Prometheus 端点和基于 DHCP 的客户端流量统计。客户端 ID 优先使用 DHCP 主"
"机名；没有主机名时回退为 MAC 地址。防火墙访问策略需单独管理。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ccsn-observability/overview.js:49
msgid "Exporter endpoints"
msgstr "Exporter 端点"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ccsn-observability/overview.js:50
#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ccsn-observability/overview.js:81
msgid "DHCP pools"
msgstr "DHCP 地址池"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ccsn-observability/overview.js:52
msgid "System exporter interface"
msgstr "系统 Exporter 接口"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ccsn-observability/overview.js:52
msgid ""
"Logical management interface for system, Wi-Fi, dnsmasq, and conntrack "
"metrics on TCP/9101. Do not bind this endpoint to an untrusted WAN interface."
msgstr ""
"在 TCP/9101 上提供系统、Wi-Fi、dnsmasq 和 conntrack 指标的逻辑管理接口。不要"
"将此端点绑定到不受信任的 WAN 接口。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ccsn-observability/overview.js:56
msgid "System exporter port"
msgstr "系统 Exporter 端口"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ccsn-observability/overview.js:60
msgid "Collect Wi-Fi station totals"
msgstr "采集 Wi-Fi 客户端统计"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ccsn-observability/overview.js:60
msgid ""
"Collect station-level metrics locally. The Kubernetes scrape policy drops "
"raw Wi-Fi station series before ingestion."
msgstr ""
"在本地采集客户端级指标。Kubernetes 抓取策略会在写入前丢弃原始 Wi-Fi 客户端序"
"列。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ccsn-observability/overview.js:65
msgid "Client-accounting exporter interface"
msgstr "客户端流量 Exporter 接口"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ccsn-observability/overview.js:65
msgid "Logical management interface for nlbwmon client accounting on TCP/9100."
msgstr "在 TCP/9100 上提供 nlbwmon 客户端流量统计的逻辑管理接口。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ccsn-observability/overview.js:69
msgid "Client-accounting exporter port"
msgstr "客户端流量 Exporter 端口"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ccsn-observability/overview.js:73
#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ccsn-observability/overview.js:75
msgid "Fallback client network"
msgstr "客户端默认网络"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ccsn-observability/overview.js:73
msgid "Used only when a client address does not match any DHCP pool CIDR."
msgstr "仅在客户端地址不匹配任何 DHCP 地址池 CIDR 时使用。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ccsn-observability/overview.js:77
#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ccsn-observability/overview.js:79
msgid "Default traffic class"
msgstr "默认流量类别"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ccsn-observability/overview.js:77
msgid ""
"Bounded label attached to client traffic, for example internet or internal."
msgstr "附加到客户端流量的有限标签，例如 internet 或 internal。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ccsn-observability/overview.js:81
msgid ""
"Each pool maps an IPv4 CIDR to a network label. Pool capacity is read from "
"the referenced DHCP section; active leases and client network labels are "
"inferred automatically."
msgstr ""
"每个地址池将一个 IPv4 CIDR 映射到网络标签。地址池容量从引用的 DHCP 配置节读"
"取；活跃租约和客户端网络标签将自动推断。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ccsn-observability/overview.js:85
#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ccsn-observability/overview.js:87
msgid "Network label"
msgstr "网络标签"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ccsn-observability/overview.js:85
msgid "Stable label such as lan, guest, or iot."
msgstr "稳定标签，例如 lan、guest 或 iot。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ccsn-observability/overview.js:89
msgid "DHCP section"
msgstr "DHCP 配置节"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ccsn-observability/overview.js:89
msgid "UCI section name in /etc/config/dhcp, usually lan."
msgstr "/etc/config/dhcp 中的 UCI 配置节名称，通常为 lan。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ccsn-observability/overview.js:93
msgid "IPv4 CIDR"
msgstr "IPv4 CIDR"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ccsn-observability/overview.js:93
msgid "Subnet used to assign clients to this network label."
msgstr "用于将客户端归入此网络标签的子网。"
